{"words": [{"text": "مَّثَلُ", "translation": "Example"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(of) those who"}, {"text": "يُنفِقُونَ", "translation": "spend"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ", "translation": "their wealth"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "كَمَثَلِ", "translation": "(is) like"}, {"text": "حَبَّةٍ", "translation": "a grain"}, {"text": "أَنۢبَتَتْ", "translation": "which grows"}, {"text": "سَبْعَ", "translation": "seven"}, {"text": "سَنَابِلَ", "translation": "ears"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "each"}, {"text": "سُنۢبُلَةٍۢ", "translation": "ear"}, {"text": "مِّا۟ئَةُ", "translation": "hundred"}, {"text": "حَبَّةٍۢ ۗ", "translation": "grain(s)"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "يُضَـٰعِفُ", "translation": "gives manifold"}, {"text": "لِمَن", "translation": "to whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ ۗ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "وَٰسِعٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Encompassing"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌ", "translation": "All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "The example of those who spend their wealth in the way of Allāh is like a seed [of grain] which grows seven spikes; in each spike is a hundred grains. And Allāh multiplies [His reward] for whom He wills. And Allāh is all-Encompassing and Knowing."}